# SharePoint DB Explorer
# Based on GitHub's VisualStudio.gitignore, trimmed to what this repository
# produces. Build output and caches are ignored; the versioned release
# downloads under releases/ are kept (see the end of this file).

## Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
*.log
artifacts/
publish/

## Repository-local SDK build output, NuGet packages and tool caches
## (redirected here by Directory.Build.props and the VS Code tasks)
.scratch/

## Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.rsuser
*.userosscache
*.userprefs
*.sln.docstates
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
ipch/
*.aps
*.ncb
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.cachefile

## Visual Studio Installer project output (installer/Debug, installer/Release)
installer/[Dd]ebug/
installer/[Rr]elease/

## Publish profiles: Installer.pubxml is shared; per-user settings are not
*.pubxml.user

## VS Code: keep the shared workspace settings only
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.code-workspace

## Alternative IDE caches
.idea/
*.sln.iml
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
*.DotSettings.user

## Test results and coverage
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info

## NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

## Files the application writes when run from the repository folder
exports/
reports/

## Restored databases and backups (contain private source data)
*.bak
*.bkp
*.trn
*.mdf
*.ndf
*.ldf

## Signing keys and secrets: never commit these
*.pfx
*.p12
*.snk
*.pvk
*.publishsettings
.env
.env.*

## Operating system files
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

## Keep only the intended versioned downloads in releases/.
## This does not override the secret/database exclusions for other files.
/releases/*
!/releases/README.md
!/releases/v*/
/releases/v*/*
!/releases/v*/setup.exe
!/releases/v*/SharePointDatabaseExplorerSetup.msi
!/releases/v*/SharePointDatabaseExplorer-v*-win-x64.zip
!/releases/v*/SharePointDatabaseExplorerInstaller-v*-win-x64.zip
!/releases/v*/SHA256SUMS.txt
